  "name": "Primalist Torn to Shreds: bleed applications, cap, duration and AP scaling",
  "contract": "Totemic Smash and Rylak's Bite apply a 12-second bleed capped at two stacks. The active tooltip promises its scaled base plus 4.5% AP across four three-second ticks. First/highest Smash ranks, nearby targets, unlearning and unrelated damage are checked; +100 AP affects each tick by 1-2 after integer rounding, and +72 SP adds no damage. Lower-rank casts explicitly unlearn higher weapon ranks first, then relearn the tested rank; the native cast path stays enabled. Rank fixtures remove the grant from all specs, including the tested lower rank, before relearning it to restore native active-rank selection. Measure the four-tick lifetime on a fresh highest-rank application after the stacking test expires.",
